OL,5,G0015 Miyazaki: Spirit Of Nature
OL,6,     FDiscover the life of Miyazaki as
OL,7,     Fwell as a profoundly ecological
OL,8,     Fbody of work that questions our
OL,9,     Frelationship with the natural
OL,10,     Fworld and creatures.
OL,11,G0150 Catching Fire: The Story Of Anita
OL,12,G     Pallenberg
OL,13,     FThis intimate documentary reveals
OL,14,     Fthe story of a fierce rock 'n'
OL,15,     Froller, actress, muse and mother
OL,16,     Fwho rose to prominence in the
OL,17,     F1960s and 1970s.
OL,18,G0400 My Week With Lubaina Himid
OL,19,     FAn exploration of Himid's life
OL,20,     Fover seven days after the crew
OL,21,     Fdeparts, as Kate captures candid
OL,22,     Fmoments with just an iPhone.
